{"title": "Ritual Drain: Astarion (Condition)", "pageid": 40704, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ritual_Drain:_Astarion_(Condition)", "categories": ["No status groups", "Has tick type", "Has stack type", "Has stack priority", "No status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Buff Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Ritual Drain: Astarion</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Has an additional bonus action after draining <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion's</a> life force. This effect can only apply once per round. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_CAZADORSPALACE_SPAWNBUFF_ASTARION</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_CAZADORSPALACE_SPAWNBUFF_ASTARION+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_CAZADORSPALACE_SPAWNBUFF_ASTARION+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_CAZADORSPALACE_SPAWNBUFF_ASTARION</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_CAZADORSPALACE_SPAWNBUFF_ASTARION%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CLOW_CAZADORSPALACE_SPAWNBUFF_ASTARION%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: do not apply\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" title=\"Stack priority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/38px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/50px-Empty_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stack priority\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png/25px-Empty_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Empty_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_priority\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack priority\">Stack priority</a>: 1</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Ritual_Drain:_Astarion\">Sources of Ritual Drain: Astarion</span></h2>\n<ul><li>A party member or allied summon<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"I'm fairly confident I've...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup> can occupy the ritual circle in front of Astarion to gain this condition</li>\n<li>Cazador receives this condition if the ritual circle in front of Astarion is not occupied, and Astarion remains both alive and imprisoned</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Occupying Astarion's ritual circle also grants one stack of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Sources_(Condition)\" title=\"Ritual Sources (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual Sources\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Buff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual_Sources_(Condition)\" title=\"Ritual Sources (Condition)\">Ritual Sources</a>, depriving Cazador of it</li>\n<li>Freeing Astarion using the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/20px-Help_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/30px-Help_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/40px-Help_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Help_Icon.webp/20px-Help_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Help_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Help\" title=\"Help\">Help</a> action disables his ritual circle and this condition</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Ritual_Drain:_Astarion\">Creatures with Ritual Drain: Astarion</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/30px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/45px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/60px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cazador Szarr\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png/30px-Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Portrait_Cazador_Szarr.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador Szarr</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Gains a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus action\">bonus action</a> from draining <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion\" title=\"Astarion\">Astarion</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202743\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2317/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30086/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11012/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.036/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1259278/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.199      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   66.199      1 -total\n 46.81%   30.987      3 Template:Hidden_code\n 24.37%   16.130      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 19.71%   13.048      7 Template:Icon_link\n 18.70%   12.378      7 Template:Icon_text\n 16.39%   10.849     24 Template:Trim\n 11.53%    7.633      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 10.60%    7.017      4 Template:Template_style\n 10.60%    7.017      1 Template:MdCharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:40704-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202743 and revision id 393737. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}